#~ msgstr "¿Cuántos aforismos contiene el Zen de Python?"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Zen lists 19 aphorisms -- a running joke being that Tim Peters left the "
#~ "\"20th\" for the reader (or the BDFL) to fill in."
#~ msgstr ""
